{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|martingal}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|fr|martingale}}, from {{etyl|pro|en}} {{m|oc|martegalo}}, feminine form of {{m|oc|martegal}}, an inhabitant of {{w|Martigues}}, which is from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|maritima}}. Alternatively from {{etyl|es|en}} {{m|es|almártaga}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A piece of [[harness]] used on a [[horse]] to keep it from raising its head above a desired point.
# {{lb|en|nautical}} A [[spar]], or piece of [[rigging]] that [[strengthen]]s the [[bowsprit]].
# {{lb|en|mathematics}} A [[stochastic]] [[process]] relating [[random]] variables to earlier values
# A [[gambling]] [[strategy]] in which one [[double]]s the [[stake]] after each [[loss]].
# {{lb|en|fencing}} A [[strap]] attached to the sword handle, preventing a sword being dropped if [[disarmed]].

